In src/pricing.ts change quote so that amount is the tax-inclusive total (the discounted price plus tax) and add a net field holding the discounted price before tax. Keep tax unchanged. Update invoiceNet in src/cart.ts so it still returns the pre-tax amount. Preserve tests.
